<title>UK: Wessex up as Merrill repeats &quot;accumulate&quot;.</title>
<headline>Wessex up as Merrill repeats &quot;accumulate&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Wessex Water Plc rose on Wednesday as analysts at Merrill Lynch repeated an &quot;accumulate&quot; rating and a 450p price target on the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>Wessex shares were up 10-1/2p at 394 by 1113 GMT.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
